    {
      "subId": "7606904",
      "subQuestName": "Explore the knights' memories",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760690401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760690401": {
            "id": "760690401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Huh, a manifestation of the Wolf Spirit... A piece I didn't know about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690402"
            ]
          },
          "760690402": {
            "id": "760690402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Who left you here? And what are you guarding? Answer me... Tell me more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690403"
            ]
          },
          "760690403": {
            "id": "760690403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690404"
            ]
          },
          "760690404": {
            "id": "760690404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roland",
            "text": "...How many times do I have to say it — this blood-soaked path is mine alone to walk. No one need follow in my footsteps.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690405"
            ]
          },
          "760690405": {
            "id": "760690405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "Hah, then let's just call it \"fate.\" Who's to say we didn't just happen to be following the same path, all the way from Mondstadt to Nod-Krai?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690406"
            ]
          },
          "760690406": {
            "id": "760690406",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "A \"fate\" wherein we revere a certain knight, who simply happens to have saved us countless times. Under such circumstances, could we be blamed for embarking on a similar path?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690407"
            ]
          },
          "760690407": {
            "id": "760690407",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "Should we not fully understand, we would still stand by as witnesses... Even if in the end, there were only us few left.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690408"
            ]
          },
          "760690408": {
            "id": "760690408",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Wolf",
            "text": "Awoo!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690409"
            ]
          },
          "760690409": {
            "id": "760690409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roland",
            "text": "If this is truly how you see it... I have no right to deny you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690410"
            ]
          },
          "760690410": {
            "id": "760690410",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690411"
            ]
          },
          "760690411": {
            "id": "760690411",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "Are those cursed monsters... all dead? And the residents nearby... Are they safe?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690412"
            ]
          },
          "760690412": {
            "id": "760690412",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "*cough*... Good... Just a shame we lack the strength to watch you make it to the end... Would that it were not so!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690413"
            ]
          },
          "760690413": {
            "id": "760690413",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "From here on out, you must walk this path alone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690414"
            ]
          },
          "760690414": {
            "id": "760690414",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roland",
            "text": "...When all is said and done, my sword could not protect them all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690415"
            ]
          },
          "760690415": {
            "id": "760690415",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roland",
            "text": "...In the end, only one remains to walk the path... Perhaps, the way it was always meant to be.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690416"
            ]
          },
          "760690416": {
            "id": "760690416",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roland",
            "text": "At the very least, let these swords, and the Wolf Spirit in this place, serve as your guardians — to prevent the dark aberrations from disturbing your eternal rest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690417"
            ]
          },
          "760690417": {
            "id": "760690417",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690418"
            ]
          },
          "760690418": {
            "id": "760690418",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "So that's how things were... The Knights of Favonius's records say that when the Bloodstained Knight departed, there were knights who chose to follow him — but they were never mentioned again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690419"
            ]
          },
          "760690419": {
            "id": "760690419",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "To think that they perished here fighting monsters... A worthy end for true Knights of Favonius.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690420"
            ]
          },
          "760690420": {
            "id": "760690420",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "But was this truly all they wished for?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690421"
            ]
          },
          "760690421": {
            "id": "760690421",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "The unextinguished flame of battle, the longing that dwells within your swords... Tell me, Knights, of your resolve.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690422"
            ]
          },
          "760690422": {
            "id": "760690422",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roland",
            "text": "I shall use the power left here by Boreas to seal off this battlefield... And that little wolf will stand vigil for you outside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690423"
            ]
          },
          "760690423": {
            "id": "760690423",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roland",
            "text": "To never be disturbed, to enjoy eternal peace, and forever be spared from witnessing the injustice of this world... If anyone is worthy of such protection, it is you, my friends.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690424"
            ]
          },
          "760690424": {
            "id": "760690424",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roland",
            "text": "So here we are — farewell, my final comrades.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690425"
            ]
          },
          "760690425": {
            "id": "760690425",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "...No...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690426"
            ]
          },
          "760690426": {
            "id": "760690426",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "...No...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690427"
            ]
          },
          "760690427": {
            "id": "760690427",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "...Let us fight...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690428"
            ]
          },
          "760690428": {
            "id": "760690428",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nameless Knights",
            "text": "...Once more...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690429"
            ]
          },
          "760690429": {
            "id": "760690429",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "That's the spirit! Surely your wishes and ambitions weren't meant to just wither away in a place like this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690430"
            ]
          },
          "760690430": {
            "id": "760690430",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Join me! And return once more...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760690431"
            ]
          },
          "760690431": {
            "id": "760690431",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "To battle!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}